id: pm-ye9v2t
title: "GH-826: extension commands need structured failure results and preserved remediation"
description: "Extension handlers cannot return a machine-readable report with a non-zero process status, while thrown handler remediation and codes are replaced by generic host guidance."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: "area:sdk",error-contract,extensions,github-intake
