completed_at: "2026-07-30T22:52:43.228Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: CommandHandlerResult carries a validated non-zero exit channel; structured payloads still render on failure; extension error code and remediation survive host rendering; CLI and SDK integration tests cover both returned and thrown failures
goal: project management = context management
objective: Give extension gates the same structured verdict and recovery contract as core commands
value: "Custom lint, policy, changelog, and preflight commands can serve both CI and agents"
impact: Removes the forced choice between structured output and a truthful process exit code
parent: pm-ugqx
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: fixed
expected_result: Extension handlers can render structured failure payloads with truthful non-zero status while preserving authored code and remediation.
actual_result: "Validated exitCode, errorCode, and remediation flow through returned and thrown extension failures into the CLI host."
