  "2026-07-30T22:51:26.873Z","harness:codex","Final local evidence: all six linked test commands passed through pm test with sandbox isolation; pnpm release:gates passed static quality, docs, SDK surface/parity, token and context evaluation, 6,584 tests at 100/100/100/100, secrets scan, packed npx smoke, and 88-command package-first dogfood. The only remaining gate is hosted analysis for the exact commit, which is unavailable until this branch is pushed. Fresh unrelated-workspace acceptance also proved strict duplicate refusal is atomic, explicit bypass and copy succeed, and core-field recovery performs no write."
  "2026-07-30T23:28:49.866Z","harness:codex","Final native-layout revalidation: the focused diff is 952 insertions and 97 deletions with no formatter churn; 406 files and 6,583 tests pass at 100% statements, branches, functions, and lines. Typecheck, ESLint, static quality, package boundary/parity, token budgets, SDK surface/import-cost/transport gates, docs, latest pm-changelog 2026.7.29-1 check mode, tracker health/history integrity, and fresh unrelated-workspace acceptance all pass."
